{"seq":1,"slug":"normalization","title":"归一化方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/stabilization/normalization","wordCount":1443,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"归一化方法\">归一化方法</h1><p>把网络堆到几十上百层，曾经几乎不可训练：每一层参数的微小变动都会在后续层级被放大，导致输入分布剧烈漂移，训练要么发散要么慢得没法用。归一化方法是化解这一困境的关键发明——通过标准化每层激活的分布，它平滑了<a href=\"../foundations/optimization-landscape\">损失地形</a>、降低了对学习率与<a href=\"init-residual\">初始化</a>的敏感度，让深网第一次变得稳定可训。这一节讲清 BatchNorm、LayerNorm、RMSNorm 三代主流方法的机制、差异，以及为什么大语言模型最终选择了后两者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-标准化激活分布\">核心概念：标准化激活分布</h2><p>归一化的基本操作是对一组激活值减均值、除标准差，再用可学习的缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 和平移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 恢复表达能力：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>γ</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{x} = \\frac{x-\\mu}{\\sqrt{\\sigma^2+\\epsilon}}, \\qquad y = \\gamma\\hat{x}+\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1903em;vertical-align:-0.93em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1966em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9134em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8734em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1266em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不同归一化方法的唯一区别，是「在哪些维度上计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>」。BatchNorm 沿批量维度统计、LayerNorm 沿特征维度统计、还有 GroupNorm、InstanceNorm 等变体。这个统计维度的选择，决定了方法对批量大小、序列长度的依赖与适用场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一层的激活张量] --&gt; B{在哪些维度算均值方差}&#10;  B --&gt;|跨批量样本 同一通道| C[BatchNorm&lt;br/&gt;依赖批量统计]&#10;  B --&gt;|同一样本 跨特征| D[LayerNorm&lt;br/&gt;与批量无关]&#10;  B --&gt;|同一样本 跨特征 不减均值| E[RMSNorm&lt;br/&gt;只除均方根]&#10;  C --&gt; F[平滑地形 加速收敛]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[更大学习率 更深网络可训]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一层的激活张量] --&gt; B{在哪些维度算均值方差}\n  B --&gt;|跨批量样本 同一通道| C[BatchNorm&lt;br/&gt;依赖批量统计]\n  B --&gt;|同一样本 跨特征| D[LayerNorm&lt;br/&gt;与批量无关]\n  B --&gt;|同一样本 跨特征 不减均值| E[RMSNorm&lt;br/&gt;只除均方根]\n  C --&gt; F[平滑地形 加速收敛]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[更大学习率 更深网络可训]</pre><p>不论哪种，效果都是让<a href=\"../foundations/backprop-autodiff\">反向传播</a>中的梯度流更平稳，从而允许更大的学习率、更快的收敛、更深的网络。</p>\n<p>归一化的实现常被拆成一行「减均值、除标准差、再仿射」的向量化计算，不同方法的差别只体现在统计维度的取法上：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def normalize(x, gamma, beta, dims, eps=1e-5):&#10;    mu = x.mean(dim=dims, keepdim=True)      # BatchNorm: dims=(0,) 跨批量&#10;    var = x.var(dim=dims, keepdim=True)      # LayerNorm: dims=(-1,) 跨特征&#10;    xhat = (x - mu) / (var + eps).sqrt()     # RMSNorm 省去 (x - mu) 这一步&#10;    return gamma * xhat + beta               # 可学习缩放与平移&#10;&#10;def rms_norm(x, gamma, eps=1e-5):&#10;    rms = (x.pow(2).mean(dim=-1, keepdim=True) + eps).sqrt()&#10;    return gamma * x / rms                   # 只除均方根，不减均值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> normalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, gamma, beta, dims, eps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dims, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keepdim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># BatchNorm: dims=(0,) 跨批量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    var </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.var(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dims, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keepdim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># LayerNorm: dims=(-1,) 跨特征</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    xhat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (var </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eps).sqrt()     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># RMSNorm 省去 (x - mu) 这一步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gamma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xhat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 可学习缩放与平移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rms_norm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, gamma, eps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x.pow(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keepdim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eps).sqrt()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gamma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rms                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只除均方根，不减均值</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正因如此，BatchNorm 与 LayerNorm 在代码上只差一个 <code>dims</code>，而 RMSNorm 只是把减均值那一步省掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"batchnorm-开创者与它的硬约束\">BatchNorm：开创者与它的硬约束</h2><p>BatchNorm 对每个通道，跨一个小批量内的所有样本计算均值方差。它当年让上百层的卷积网络第一次可训，是深度学习走向「深」的里程碑之一。但它有两个硬约束限制了适用面：</p>\n<p>其一是依赖批量统计。批量太小时（如目标检测、显存受限场景），均值方差估计噪声大，性能急剧下降。其二是训练与推理行为不一致：训练用当前批量的统计量，推理时单个样本没有「批量」，只能用训练期累积的滑动平均，这个切换是 BatchNorm 一类难调 bug 的常见来源。此外它在序列长度可变的 RNN、Transformer 上很难自然套用——这些缺陷直接催生了 LayerNorm。</p>\n<h2 id=\"layernorm-与-rmsnorm-大模型的选择\">LayerNorm 与 RMSNorm：大模型的选择</h2><p>LayerNorm 改为对单个样本、跨其所有特征维度计算均值方差。这样它彻底摆脱了批量依赖，训练与推理行为完全一致，且天然适配变长序列——这正是 Transformer 与大语言模型采用它的原因。</p>\n<p>RMSNorm 是 LayerNorm 的简化：它去掉减均值这一步，只用激活的均方根（RMS）做缩放：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x} = \\frac{x}{\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{d}\\sum_i x_i^2 + \\epsilon}}\\cdot\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8376em;vertical-align:-1.73em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2351em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2351em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1951em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6049em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4651em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2351em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.9121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2351em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.73em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>省去均值统计后，RMSNorm 计算更省、数值更稳，而实验表明效果与 LayerNorm 相当甚至略好。到 2026 年，RMSNorm 已成为主流大语言模型（LLaMA、Qwen、DeepSeek 等系列）的标配归一化层。</p>\n<p>下表对比三代方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>统计维度</th>\n<th>批量依赖</th>\n<th>训练/推理一致</th>\n<th>主要适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BatchNorm</td>\n<td>跨批量、单通道</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>否（需滑动平均）</td>\n<td>CNN、大批量视觉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LayerNorm</td>\n<td>单样本、跨特征</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>RNN、早期 Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RMSNorm</td>\n<td>单样本、跨特征（不减均值）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>现代大语言模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"放在哪里-pre-norm-与-post-norm\">放在哪里：Pre-Norm 与 Post-Norm</h2><p>归一化层在残差块里的位置对训练稳定性影响巨大，这一点与<a href=\"init-residual\">残差连接</a>紧密相关。原始 Transformer 用 Post-Norm（归一化放在残差相加之后），深层训练时容易梯度不稳、需要小心的预热。后来主流转向 Pre-Norm（归一化放在子层输入处、残差路径保持「干净」），它让梯度能更直接地沿残差通路回传，深层网络的训练稳定性显著提升，是今天大模型的默认布局。</p>\n<p>这也是为什么<a href=\"../optimizers/lr-scheduling\">学习率预热</a>的必要性与归一化方案相关：Pre-Norm 配合预热基本能稳住绝大多数大模型训练，而 Post-Norm 对预热和初始化更挑剔。归一化、残差位置、初始化、预热这四者，共同构成深网稳定训练的一套组合拳。</p>\n<p>两种布局各有取舍，并非 Pre-Norm 全面胜出：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>布局</th>\n<th>梯度通路</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n<th>表达能力</th>\n<th>现状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pre-Norm</td>\n<td>残差路径干净，梯度直达浅层</td>\n<td>好训，容忍大学习率</td>\n<td>深层子层输入被归一化</td>\n<td>大模型默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Post-Norm</td>\n<td>归一化插在残差相加之后</td>\n<td>深层易不稳</td>\n<td>保留未经归一的残差和</td>\n<td>早期 Transformer、部分视觉模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Post-Norm 的表达能力在理论上略强，代价是训练更依赖预热与初始化的精细配合；Pre-Norm 用一点表达力换取显著更稳的深层训练，这在大模型时代几乎是稳赚的交换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>归一化通过标准化每层激活分布，平滑损失地形、降低对学习率与初始化的敏感度，让深网稳定可训。</li>\n<li>三代方法的唯一区别是统计维度：BatchNorm 跨批量、LayerNorm 跨特征、RMSNorm 跨特征且省去减均值。</li>\n<li>BatchNorm 受小批量噪声与训练/推理不一致所限，难用于变长序列，催生了与批量无关的 LayerNorm。</li>\n<li>RMSNorm 更省更稳、效果相当，到 2026 年已是主流大语言模型的标配。</li>\n<li>归一化的位置（Pre-Norm vs Post-Norm）显著影响稳定性，与残差连接、初始化、预热共同构成深网训练的组合拳。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"归一化方法","id":"归一化方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：标准化激活分布","id":"核心概念-标准化激活分布"},{"level":2,"text":"BatchNorm：开创者与它的硬约束","id":"batchnorm-开创者与它的硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"LayerNorm 与 RMSNorm：大模型的选择","id":"layernorm-与-rmsnorm-大模型的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"放在哪里：Pre-Norm 与 Post-Norm","id":"放在哪里-pre-norm-与-post-norm"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"学习率调度与预热","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/optimizers/lr-scheduling"},"next":{"title":"正则化与 Dropout","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/stabilization/regularization"}}